&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of European AML/CTF directives, as well as local regulatory frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience handling SAR/STR reporting and communication with local Financial Intelligence Units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required, along with professional fluency in Italian.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree (ideally in law, business or finance) is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced use of MS Office (G suits) skills for Excel and Word. Salesforce experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
