&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;Business Risk Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Growth Operations team and serve as the essential guardian of our marketing integrity. At N26, we know that in a highly regulated banking environment, true disruption and sustainable growth can only happen when built on a foundation of trust and regulatory excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;In this role, you will be the primary bridge connecting our high-velocity Marketing teams with our Legal, Compliance, Risk, and Internal Audit functions. You will own the organisational knowledge base of our growth engine - mapping processes, resolving audit findings, and ensuring that every campaign and tool we launch meets the highest standards of compliance. If you are a proactive operator who loves bringing order to complexity and thrives on building robust, audit-ready systems that enable rather than block innovation, this is a unique opportunity to protect and accelerate our global expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the Growth Governance Landscape: Lead the end-to-end mapping of our Standard Operating Procedures, ensuring all marketing processes and tool integrations are fully compliant with regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;Bridge Marketing &amp;amp; Compliance: Act as a dedicated partner for the Legal, Compliance, and Internal Audit teams, translating complex regulatory requirements into clear, actionable playbooks for our Growth and Marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;Lead Audit Resolution &amp;amp; Risk Mitigation: Take full ownership of resolving audit findings and managing business continuity, proactively identifying and closing process gaps before they impact our go-to-market speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;Architect the Marketing Knowledge Base: Build and maintain a comprehensive, accessible internal knowledge base, centralising everything from product feature playbooks to brand guidelines to ensure global consistency and seamless onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;Drive Compliance Enablement &amp;amp; Training: Develop and deliver engaging training programs for the Marketing organization so that all team members understand our regulatory obligations and feel confident following established processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;Ensure Regulatory Quality Control: Implement robust validation processes so that all marketing initiatives, from creative assets to data handling ,capture and adhere to the latest regulatory standards (e.g., GDPR, KWG, MaRisk, WpHG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Compliance Expertise: 3-5+ years of proven experience in process management, internal audit, risk management, or marketing compliance, ideally within a regulated industry like Fintech or Banking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; Workflow Management Skills: A passion for clarity with a demonstrated ability to map complex, cross-functional workflows and maintain high-quality internal documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;Effective Educator &amp;amp; Communicator: The ability to take complex legal or regulatory topics and translate them into engaging training sessions and simple, actionable guidance for non-experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;Structural &amp;amp; Analytical Thinking: You possess a &quot;compliance-by-design&quot; mindset—able to look at a creative or technical process and immediately identify potential risks, missing steps, or efficiency gains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Orchestration: You are a collaborative communicator who can navigate technical, legal, and creative conversations, building consensus across teams with different priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;Commitment to Results: You are a proactive operator who takes full ownership of the compliance roadmap, ensuring that audit remediations are successfully completed and seamlessly integrated into our daily workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
