&lt;p&gt;N26 has reimagined banking for today’s digital world. Technology and design empower &lt;a href=&quot;https://n26.com/en-eu/blog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;everything we do&lt;/a&gt; and it’s how we are building the global banking platform the world loves to use.We&#39;ve eliminated physical branches, paperwork, and hidden fees for an elegant digital experience and supreme savings. Giving people the power to live and bank their way is what gets us out of bed in the morning and inspires the work that we do. We are headquartered in Berlin with offices in multiple cities across Europe, including Vienna and Barcelona, and a 1,500-strong team of more than 80 nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
