&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower retail investors by turning complex wealth-building tools into seamless, intuitive customer experiences.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Investments team exists to help everyday people build a better relationship with their money and achieve long-term financial stability. We build accessible, transparent, and compliant investment products - spanning stocks, ETFs, crypto, and managed portfolios - that make wealth creation effortless for millions of users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager on the Investments team, you will take end-to-end ownership of key capabilities and results across one of our core Wealth building verticals. Working at the intersection of UX, product strategy, and financial engineering, you will translate complex market mechanics and regulatory requirements into simple, engaging products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won&#39;t be managing features in isolation - you will act as the central operational node, bringing together engineering, design, compliance, legal, and external B2B partners to ship impactful, scalable products safely and swiftly. You will join an ambitious team with direct impact, high autonomy, and clear runway to drive meaningful product outcomes from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own a team’s Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full product ownership of the team’s scope, translating strategic priorities into well defined roadmaps and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive execution grounded in evidence:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the product development lifecycle for new and existing Investments features—from initial user research and technical scoping to engineering delivery, go-to- market strategy, and post-launch iteration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate Complex Ecosystems&lt;/strong&gt;: Act as the central node between engineering, design, compliance, and legal teams to safely and swiftly bring scalable products to market while adhering to strict regulatory requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Stakeholder relationships: &lt;/strong&gt;Working closely with other teams is a fundamental aspect of the success you can have as a product manager. Building relationships with other team players early on is critical.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven and evidence-grounded decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Dive deep into user behavior, market trends, and competitive analysis to uncover new opportunities, optimize the customer journey, and continuously refine our portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Product Management Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of product management experience, with a track record of shipping complex digital products end-to-end. Experience within Investments or Fintech is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Bias for Action:&lt;/strong&gt; Strategic thinker who can craft a long-term product vision while executing effectively in the short term—moving forward, making quick decisions, and driving outcomes with comfort in a fast-moving, liquid, and ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
