&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User Empathy &amp;amp; UX Intuition:&lt;/strong&gt; You care deeply about UX and know how to translate complex financial concepts and market mechanics into simple, intuitive, and engaging customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
