&lt;li&gt;Good English and German language skills, or proficiency in English and the local language where the role is located.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
