&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At N26, we are transforming how people bank. Our Internal Communications team plays a central role in that journey, partnering closely with senior leaders and cross-functional teams to ensure N26ers understand what is happening, why it matters, and what it means for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a practical, proactive Senior Specialist to join us on a parental cover contract (2 years, with possibility to extend). Reporting to the Head of Internal Communications, you will shape how communications land across the business by creating clear, engaging assets at pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you excel at simplifying complex topics and turning information into messaging people truly understand, and you’d like to join a collaborative and engaged team where you can grow, this role is for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create and deliver multimedia content:&lt;/strong&gt; Draft engaging emails, newsletters, presentations, intranet content, and videos (using tools like Synthesia) for business priorities, product launches, performance cycles, and people stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage internal communications delivery and analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain the global IC content planner, moderate hybrid company meetings, and continuously measure, report on, and optimize message performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support core operations and intranet project:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on execution of operational comms, including leading content cleanup and migration for N26’s new intranet launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with the CEO Office, People Team, Product Leads, and External Comms to deliver clear, compliant messaging aligned with Works Council and entity-specific requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide agile event and emergency support:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist with high-urgency comms, rapid data gathering, employee feedback analysis, and logistics for events like Hackathons and Recognition Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
