&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in internal/employee communications within a fast-paced, international, hybrid environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience delivering &lt;strong&gt;HR, change, and business strategy communications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating effectively in &lt;strong&gt;regulated or complex settings&lt;/strong&gt; with multi-entity and labor/Works Council interdependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
