&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content creation and tools: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Meticulous deck-building, basic video editing, and proficiency with Google Workspace, Excel/Sheets, and tools like Synthesia.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data and analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable measuring content performance, tracking metrics, and refining strategy based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution and detail:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly organized, delivery-focused, and capable of managing multiple projects under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability and proactivity: &lt;/strong&gt;Thriving in a fast-paced, evolving environment. Proactive and energetic, combined with feedback-readiness, and strong team alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
